 of 19,000 spectators were present over the course of the competition."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The tournament itself will go down as one of the most contentious in Olympic history, with protests, withdrawals, demonstrations and near-riots occurred, usually directed at the standard of the officiating."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/21440"} "Flyweight (≤112 pounds), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "15 – 20 July 1924"] "\n" [:td {} "19"] "\n" [:td {} "13"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/21465"} "Bantamweight (≤118 pounds), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "15 – 20 July 1924"] "\n" [:td {} "21"] "\n" [:td {} "15"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/21492"} "Featherweight (≤126 pounds), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "15 – 20 July 1924"] "\n" [:td {} "24"] "\n" [:td {} "17"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/21522"} "Lightweight (≤135 pounds), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "16 – 20 July 1924"] "\n" [:td {} "30"] "\n" [:td {} "22"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/21558"} "Welterweight (≤147 pounds), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "15 – 20 July 1924"] "\n" [:td {} "29"] "\n" [:td {} "18"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/21593"} "Middleweight (≤160 pounds), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "15 – 20 July 1924"] "\n" [:td {} "23"] "\n" [:td {} "14"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/21622"} "Light-Heavyweight (≤175 pounds), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "16 – 20 July 1924"] "\n" [:td {} "20"] "\n" [:td {} "14"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/21649"} "Heavyweight (&gt;175 pounds), Men"]] "\n" [:td {}